; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1669  ** Description     : This API initializes the PLLs and other MCU specific     **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1670  **                   clock options. The PLL lock procedure is started (if PLL **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1671  **                   shall be initialized) for system and peripheral PLLs,    **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1672  **                   but the function does not wait until the peripheral PLL  **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1673  **                   is locked                                                **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1674  **                   Note: Mcu_InitClock only initializes the PLL parameters. **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1675  **                         PLL clock will be activated to the MCU distribution**
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1676  **                         only after the system PLL is also locked and then  **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1677  **                         Mcu_DistributePllClock shall be called. i.e The    **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1678  **                         sequence to activate PLL clock to the MCU clock    **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1679  **                         distribution is:                                   **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1680  **                         1)Call Mcu_InitClock                               **
